---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FacebookLink from '../components/FacebookLink.astro';
---
<Layout title="Shipping & Everett pickup">
 <section class="page-intro"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow kicker">From our print bed to you</p><h1>Near or a little further.</h1><p class="lede">Choose shipping or local pickup in Everett, Washington.</p></div></section>
 <div class="container prose"><h2>Local pickup in Everett, WA</h2><p>Choose Everett pickup when placing your order or sending a project request. We'll confirm when your print is ready and share collection instructions directly with you. Please wait for that confirmation before planning your visit.</p><h2>Shipping</h2><p>For custom work, shipping costs and the destination are confirmed with your quote. When online checkout is available for a product, the applicable shipping charge is shown before payment.</p><p>Print preparation time and shipping time are separate. We'll confirm the expected timing for your order and provide tracking when it ships.</p><h2>Before placing an order</h2><p>Check the product details and ask about size, material, color, or intended use if you're unsure. Availability, custom changes, delivery timing, and any order-specific terms are confirmed before payment.</p><h2>Questions about your print?</h2><p>Message <FacebookLink>Foggy Layers on Facebook</FacebookLink> to ask about a collection item or discuss the delivery details for a custom piece.</p></div>
</Layout>
